{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S01、S05等短停留段静态感受词铺得过密，容易让观众来不及扫完；Y的左右分栏更利于快速定位。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X虽然阅读负担较重，但重点词加亮、叙述与感受交替，以及按音乐节点出现的细节，让观众更容易抓住心理转折，也能感受到音乐变化与人物心境之间的对应。尤其S07、S11—S13，X保留了互相依靠、愿意付出、害怕失去之间的细微因果关系；Y压缩后更好扫，却把一些重要动机和心理层次简化了。综合来看，X传达的信息更有深度，前后情感发展也更完整。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7e466ee2-f7f4-41bc-a14b-c20b0a5ec118", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T155100597469Z", "elapsed_seconds": 105.672, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T15:52:46.271365+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e992bd0296521a7b8f71bc98a97ee2e8754dc5925c6cc8f8b9e68777f7f88e87", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments